<title>SWITZERLAND: Berner expects steady 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Berner expects steady 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE, Switzerland 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss insurer Berner Holding said that it expects its results for 1996 to be roughly in line with those of 1995.</p>
<p>In a statement detailing nine-month results, Berner said: &quot;For the business year 1996, total results are expected to be in line with those of the previous year, provided that there are no unforeseen events before year-end.&quot;</p>
<p>Berner Holding is 51.0-percent owned by German insurance group Allianz AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
